{"created": "2024-03-21T18:22:30.296999+00:00", "modified": "2024-03-29T17:32:51.505241+00:00", "id": 10685499, "conceptrecid": "8240463", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10685499", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.8240463", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10685499", "metadata": {"title": "SCimilarity Models", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10685499", "publication_date": "2024-02-20", "description": "<p>SCimilarity is a unifying representation of single-cell expression profiles that quantifies similarity between expression states and generalizes to represent new studies without additional training. This enables a novel cell search capability, which sifts through millions of profiles to find cells similar to a query cell state and allows researchers to quickly and systematically leverage massive public scRNA-seq atlases to learn about a cell state of interest.</p>\n<p>This repository includes model weights, embeddings, kNN graphs, and metadata for the SCimilarity cell search model as a single tarball.</p>\n<p>This release of the model is intended for use with v0.2.0 of the SCimilarity API.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Heimberg, Graham", "affiliation": "Genentech, Inc.", "orcid": "0009-0002-6493-5721"}, {"name": "Kuo, Tony", "affiliation": "F. Hoffmann-La Roche, Ltd."}, {"name": "Diamant, Nathaniel", "affiliation": "Genentech, Inc.", "orcid": "0000-0002-1738-304X"}, {"name": "Omar Salem", "affiliation": "F. Hoffmann-La Roche, Ltd.", "orcid": "0009-0005-1514-831X"}, {"name": "Bravo, H\u00e9ctor Corrada", "affiliation": "Genentech, Inc.", "orcid": "0000-0002-1255-4444"}, {"name": "Vander\u00a0Heiden, Jason", "affiliation": "Genentech, Inc.", "orcid": "0000-0002-1474-310X"}], "keywords": ["SCimilarity", "single-cell RNA-seq", "deep learning", "cell query", "cell search", "cell type annotation", "cell type classification"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1101/2023.07.18.549537", "relation": "isPublishedIn", "resource_type": "publication-article"